<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids Water Cycle" id="00126cd9" height="339" width="556" hasaudio="0" hascredits="0" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Kids1" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="102"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;El agua que cae a la superficie terrestre desde la atmósfera son las precipitaciones. Pueden ser de diversas formas: lluvia, nieve, granizo...&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Las precipitaciones&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126cd9-1.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="332" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="32" y="25"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>24</x><y>18</y></point></points><origin><x>76</x><y>35</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Nieve&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Nieve&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="28" y="26" w="48" h="17"/></label><label labelid="333" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="239" y="94"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>17</x><y>11</y></point></points><origin><x>285</x><y>104</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Lluvia&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="4"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Lluvia&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="235" y="95" w="50" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>308</imageheight><imagewidth>400</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Las precipitaciones&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="2" slideid="103"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;El agua de las precipitaciones se almacena en la superficie terrestre en formas líquidas (océanos, ríos y lagos) y sólidas (hielo y nieve de los glaciares e icebergs). Algunas precipitaciones se infiltran bajo la superficie terrestre y allí se almacenan y fluyen entre las rocas del subsuelo: son las aguas subterráneas. &lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Las reservas y almacenamiento&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126cd9-2.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="334" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="133" y="32"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-23</x><y>17</y></point></points><origin><x>129</x><y>42</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Hielo y nieve&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Hielo y nieve&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="129" y="33" w="98" h="17"/></label><label labelid="335" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="204" y="67"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-44</x><y>38</y></point></points><origin><x>200</x><y>77</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Lago&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Lago&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="200" y="68" w="41" h="17"/></label><label labelid="336" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="331" y="262"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-62</y></point></points><origin><x>327</x><y>272</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Océano&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Océano&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="327" y="263" w="60" h="17"/></label><label labelid="337" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="86" y="262"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-118</y></point></points><origin><x>82</x><y>272</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Aguas subterráneas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Aguas subterráneas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="82" y="263" w="141" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>308</imageheight><imagewidth>400</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Las reservas y almacenamiento&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="3" slideid="104"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;El agua que fluye desde la tierra hasta los arroyos, ríos, lagos y océanos se llama escorrentía. La escorrentía se reduce durante los periodos de sequía y las estaciones secas, y aumenta con las estaciones lluviosas, las tormentas y los deshielos.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;La escorrentía&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126cd9-3.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="338" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="162" y="32"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-45</x><y>39</y></point></points><origin><x>158</x><y>42</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Nieve y hielo fundidos&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Nieve y hielo fundidos&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="158" y="33" w="160" h="17"/></label><label labelid="339" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="278" y="67"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-69</x><y>63</y></point></points><origin><x>274</x><y>77</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Río&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Río&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="274" y="68" w="31" h="17"/></label><label labelid="340" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="278" y="95"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-64</x><y>58</y></point></points><origin><x>274</x><y>105</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Escorrentía&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="4"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Escorrentía&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="274" y="96" w="86" h="17"/></label><label labelid="341" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="23" y="243"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>-45</y></point></points><origin><x>160</x><y>253</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Aguas subterráneas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Aguas subterráneas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="19" y="244" w="141" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>308</imageheight><imagewidth>400</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;La escorrentía&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="4" slideid="105"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;El agua de los océanos y de la tierra es absorbida por la atmósfera mediante un proceso llamado evaporación. Cuando el agua se evapora pasa de un estado líquido a un estado gaseoso, es decir, el agua líquida se convierte en vapor de agua. La mayor parte del agua que llega a la atmósfera se evapora desde la superficie de los océanos. El agua también se puede evaporar desde las plantas y a este proceso se le llama transpiración. &lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;La evaporación y la transpiración&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126cd9-4.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="342" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="21" y="9"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>38</y></point></points><origin><x>160</x><y>27</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Evaporación de las aguas continentales&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Evaporación de las&lt;br&gt;aguas continentales&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="17" y="10" w="143" h="33"/></label><label labelid="343" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="233" y="29"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-19</x><y>13</y></point></points><origin><x>229</x><y>47</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Transpiración de las plantas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Transpiración de las&lt;br&gt;plantas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="229" y="30" w="153" h="33"/></label><label labelid="344" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="270" y="103"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Evaporación de las aguas oceánicas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Evaporación de&lt;br&gt;las aguas oceánicas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="266" y="104" w="139" h="33"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>308</imageheight><imagewidth>400</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;La evaporación y la transpiración&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="5" slideid="106"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;El vapor de agua se enfría a medida que se eleva en la atmósfera. Al enfriarse se condensa, es decir, el vapor de agua se convierte en gotitas de agua o en diminutos cristales de hielo y se forman las nubes. Cuando las gotas de agua y cristales de hielo pesan lo suficiente, caen en forma de precipitaciones desde las nubes, y de esta forma continúa el ciclo del agua.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;La condensación&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126cd9-5.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="345" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="156" y="32"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>36</x><y>30</y></point></points><origin><x>255</x><y>42</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Condensación&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Condensación&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="152" y="33" w="103" h="17"/></label><label labelid="346" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="324" y="28"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext/><audiorefid/><bgrct x="320" y="29" w="5" h="-1"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>308</imageheight><imagewidth>400</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;La condensación&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;htm